# Project: DripRide Admin Panel
- Stack: Vite, React 19, Tailwind CSS, Lucide Icons.
- Style: Modern, high-end "Drip" aesthetic. Use dark mode by default with vibrant accents (e.g., Electric Blue or Neon Purple).
- Rules: 
  - Use functional components and clean Tailwind classes.
  - Implement a "Slice" architecture (feature-based folders).
  - Use Lucide-React for all icons.
  - Prioritize responsiveness for tablet/desktop.